  "user_request_original": "Optimize a 16-layer alternating HfO2/SiO2 stack on fused silica substrate with air incidence. Layer sequence: HfO2(1), SiO2(2), HfO2(3), SiO2(4), HfO2(5), SiO2(6), HfO2(7), SiO2(8), HfO2(9), SiO2(10), HfO2(11), SiO2(12), HfO2(13), SiO2(14), HfO2(15), SiO2(16). Initialize optimization with median thickness values per layer: layer_1=116.0 nm, layer_2=87.33 nm, layer_3=135.37 nm, layer_4=180.0 nm, layer_5=123.37 nm, layer_6=74.66 nm, layer_7=108.75 nm, layer_8=90.0 nm, layer_9=131.0 nm, layer_10=101.15 nm, layer_11=127.06 nm, layer_12=126.07 nm, layer_13=116.12 nm, layer_14=76.42 nm, layer_15=164.60 nm, layer_16=85.0 nm. Set optimization bounds for each layer thickness to median value ± 15%. Optimize all 16 thicknesses simultaneously to maximize transmission in 1000-1700 nm and reflection in 300-450 nm. Use gradient-based or differential evolution optimizer with sufficient iterations to converge within contracted bounds. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 300-450 nm, 1000-1700 nm. soft objectives: high transmission in 1000-1700 nm; high reflection in 300-450 nm. behaviors to suppress or avoid: reflection in 1000-1700 nm; transmission in 300-450 nm. manufacturing constraints: total layer count <= 30.",
  "normalized_request_english": "Optimize the thicknesses of a 16-layer alternating HfO2/SiO2 coating on a fused-silica substrate under normal air incidence. Constrain each layer between 85% and 115% of its provided median initial value. Simultaneously maximize transmission and minimize reflection in the 1000–1700 nm band, while maximizing reflection and minimizing transmission in the 300–450 nm band using a coherent transfer-matrix solver and gradient-based search.",
